      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I'm experiencing the same issue with a HLS stream from my own MediaMTX server - plays fine in VLC and via the web browser, but no audio plays from the VRC clients. I'm also noticing that the AVPro player video is very delayed from the stream itself - on a webpage the HLS player only has a 2~3 second delay, but in VRC it seems to be ~40 seconds behind the live stream - that's with the AVPro low latency toggle on. \n\nMy HLS stream is https://live.stream.starcollection.mu:8888/stream/test/ - https://live.stream.starcollection.mu:8888/stream/test/index.m3u8\n\nI will try to leave the test stream up and running as long as I can",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
